    "detailed_description": "In the medieval times there used to be battles, kingdoms used to fight to conquer each other, and on that concept a game was created named &quot;Chess&quot;.<br>Experience those fights in the Real world as well as Demon world graphics.<br>The game is not limited to human characters but also has a variety of Demonic characters and a lot of customizations for every character!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><strong>COMBAT VIEW</strong><br>You can turn on and turn off combat view in the game.<br>If the combat view is on, then the attacking camera will zoom in to show the fight.<br>If the combat view is off, then the game is all time top down.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/9a22ef4d0a2bdfe94cec851be517ade5.poster.avif?t=1723879526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/9a22ef4d0a2bdfe94cec851be517ade5.webm?t=1723879526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/9a22ef4d0a2bdfe94cec851be517ade5.mp4?t=1723879526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>RPG MODE</strong><br>You can turn on and turn off RPG Mode in the game.<br>If the RPG Mode is on, then you get a menu to select the attack from the available attacks.<br>If the RPG Mode is off, then the attack is selected randomly.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/abf983b03f7724452baafed84c078066.poster.avif?t=1723879526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/abf983b03f7724452baafed84c078066.webm?t=1723879526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/abf983b03f7724452baafed84c078066.mp4?t=1723879526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>2D CHESSBOARD</strong><br>You can see complete game status on that 2D Chess Board also you can draw lines on it to make your strategy.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/37f07a304a68c4307d12a6acb2ff9ca1.poster.avif?t=1723879526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/37f07a304a68c4307d12a6acb2ff9ca1.webm?t=1723879526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/37f07a304a68c4307d12a6acb2ff9ca1.mp4?t=1723879526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><br><strong>OFFLINE</strong> : Play with computer AI.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>Player Vs Computer</i><br></li><li><i>Computer Vs Player</i><br></li><li><i>Player Vs Player</i></li></ul><br><strong>ONLINE</strong> : Play with your family, friends or anyone in the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/0fe06c9022b86cf8bf6af040a1197731.avif?t=1723879526\" /></div><br><strong>3D Maps</strong><br><strong>8</strong> different 3D maps, more options will come in future.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>Asian Kingdom</i><br></li><li><i>Castle</i><br></li><li><i>Dungeon</i><br></li><li><i>Aztec Temple</i><br></li><li><i>Eternal Temple</i><br></li><li><i>Ruins</i><br></li><li><i>Grim Temple</i><br></li><li><i>Graveyard</i></li></ul><br><strong>3D Characters</strong><br><strong>82</strong> different 3D characters, more options will come in future.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>14 Kings</i><br></li><li><i>14 Queens</i><br></li><li><i>13 Bishops</i><br></li><li><i>15 Knights</i><br></li><li><i>13 Rooks</i><br></li><li><i>13 Pawns</i></li></ul>Each character can be customized individually.<br><br><strong>Character Customizations Includes</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>Armor Colors</i><br></li><li><i>Skin Colors</i><br></li><li><i>Hair Colors</i><br></li><li><i>Hair Styles</i><br></li><li><i>Weapon Customizations</i><br></li><li><i>Weapon Effects and more</i></li></ul><i>For more details, please check videos.</i><br><br><strong>Chess Board Customizations</strong><br><strong>80</strong> different chess board color options which can make a total of <strong>6400</strong> combinations, more options will come in future.<br><br><strong>Move Effect Customizations</strong><br><strong>7</strong> different types of move effects and every effect has its own levels.<br><i>For more details, please check videos.</i><br><br><strong>3D Chess Pieces</strong><br>Play with 3D Chess Pieces too.<br>Colors can also be customized.<br><br><strong>Reference Chess Pieces</strong><br>In game you will have reference pieces above the board which will help in identifying the 3D Chess Characters and Pieces easily.<br>If you want, you can turn off the feature from settings.<br>Colors can also be customized.<br><br><strong>Magical Experience</strong> <br>Many characters have magic effects, enjoy the effects in battle!<br><br><strong>Cinematic Experience</strong><br>Every map has its own cinematic experience!<br><br><strong>Hide Chess Characters &amp; Pieces</strong><br>In the middle of the game, you can even hide chess characters or pieces!<br><br><strong>Multiple Languages</strong><br>Game supports 16 Languages other than English!<br>For Audio's only English.<br>Those 16 languages are converted via online translator so there is possibility of inappropriate translations.<br><i>Join our discord server and help us correct the translations and get shout out in the server and other gifts</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Share Your Suggestions</strong></h2>Share your ideas to improve the game with us. We are great listeners!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> <i> Discord </i> </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Report Bug</strong></h2>Report bugs to get them fixed as soon as possible.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> <i> Discord </i> </li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "In the medieval times there used to be battles, kingdoms used to fight to conquer each other, and on that concept a game was created named &quot;Chess&quot;.<br>Experience those fights in the Real world as well as Demon world graphics.<br>The game is not limited to human characters but also has a variety of Demonic characters and a lot of customizations for every character!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><strong>COMBAT VIEW</strong><br>You can turn on and turn off combat view in the game.<br>If the combat view is on, then the attacking camera will zoom in to show the fight.<br>If the combat view is off, then the game is all time top down.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/9a22ef4d0a2bdfe94cec851be517ade5.poster.avif?t=1723879526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/9a22ef4d0a2bdfe94cec851be517ade5.webm?t=1723879526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/9a22ef4d0a2bdfe94cec851be517ade5.mp4?t=1723879526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>RPG MODE</strong><br>You can turn on and turn off RPG Mode in the game.<br>If the RPG Mode is on, then you get a menu to select the attack from the available attacks.<br>If the RPG Mode is off, then the attack is selected randomly.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/abf983b03f7724452baafed84c078066.poster.avif?t=1723879526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/abf983b03f7724452baafed84c078066.webm?t=1723879526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/abf983b03f7724452baafed84c078066.mp4?t=1723879526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>2D CHESSBOARD</strong><br>You can see complete game status on that 2D Chess Board also you can draw lines on it to make your strategy.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/37f07a304a68c4307d12a6acb2ff9ca1.poster.avif?t=1723879526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/37f07a304a68c4307d12a6acb2ff9ca1.webm?t=1723879526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/37f07a304a68c4307d12a6acb2ff9ca1.mp4?t=1723879526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><br><strong>OFFLINE</strong> : Play with computer AI.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>Player Vs Computer</i><br></li><li><i>Computer Vs Player</i><br></li><li><i>Player Vs Player</i></li></ul><br><strong>ONLINE</strong> : Play with your family, friends or anyone in the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949140/extras/0fe06c9022b86cf8bf6af040a1197731.avif?t=1723879526\" /></div><br><strong>3D Maps</strong><br><strong>8</strong> different 3D maps, more options will come in future.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>Asian Kingdom</i><br></li><li><i>Castle</i><br></li><li><i>Dungeon</i><br></li><li><i>Aztec Temple</i><br></li><li><i>Eternal Temple</i><br></li><li><i>Ruins</i><br></li><li><i>Grim Temple</i><br></li><li><i>Graveyard</i></li></ul><br><strong>3D Characters</strong><br><strong>82</strong> different 3D characters, more options will come in future.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>14 Kings</i><br></li><li><i>14 Queens</i><br></li><li><i>13 Bishops</i><br></li><li><i>15 Knights</i><br></li><li><i>13 Rooks</i><br></li><li><i>13 Pawns</i></li></ul>Each character can be customized individually.<br><br><strong>Character Customizations Includes</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>Armor Colors</i><br></li><li><i>Skin Colors</i><br></li><li><i>Hair Colors</i><br></li><li><i>Hair Styles</i><br></li><li><i>Weapon Customizations</i><br></li><li><i>Weapon Effects and more</i></li></ul><i>For more details, please check videos.</i><br><br><strong>Chess Board Customizations</strong><br><strong>80</strong> different chess board color options which can make a total of <strong>6400</strong> combinations, more options will come in future.<br><br><strong>Move Effect Customizations</strong><br><strong>7</strong> different types of move effects and every effect has its own levels.<br><i>For more details, please check videos.</i><br><br><strong>3D Chess Pieces</strong><br>Play with 3D Chess Pieces too.<br>Colors can also be customized.<br><br><strong>Reference Chess Pieces</strong><br>In game you will have reference pieces above the board which will help in identifying the 3D Chess Characters and Pieces easily.<br>If you want, you can turn off the feature from settings.<br>Colors can also be customized.<br><br><strong>Magical Experience</strong> <br>Many characters have magic effects, enjoy the effects in battle!<br><br><strong>Cinematic Experience</strong><br>Every map has its own cinematic experience!<br><br><strong>Hide Chess Characters &amp; Pieces</strong><br>In the middle of the game, you can even hide chess characters or pieces!<br><br><strong>Multiple Languages</strong><br>Game supports 16 Languages other than English!<br>For Audio's only English.<br>Those 16 languages are converted via online translator so there is possibility of inappropriate translations.<br><i>Join our discord server and help us correct the translations and get shout out in the server and other gifts</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Share Your Suggestions</strong></h2>Share your ideas to improve the game with us. We are great listeners!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> <i> Discord </i> </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Report Bug</strong></h2>Report bugs to get them fixed as soon as possible.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> <i> Discord </i> </li></ul>",
